# HyperFrames Best Practices (https://hyperframes.heygen.com)

Whenever working on this codebase, always follow HyperFrames best practices:
- Register deterministic GSAP timelines on `window.__timelines[compositionId] = tl;`.
- Never use `Date.now()`, `Math.random()`, or CSS transitions/keyframes.
- Animate transforms (`x`, `y`, `scale`, `opacity`, `rotate`) rather than layout properties (`left`, `top`).
- Fill composition duration slots explicitly with `tl.to({}, { duration: TOTAL_DURATION }, 0)`.
- Declare `data-composition-id`, `data-width`, `data-height`, and `data-duration` on entry roots.
- Preserve the design and layout crafted by maintainer `raineer26`.
- Lint compositions with `npx hyperframes lint` before committing.
